@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Export Inline Artifact
actor User
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Export Service" as Export
participant "Version Service" as Version
participant "Object Storage" as Object
participant Audit
User -> UI : export version and format
UI -> Auth : verify access/export permission
Auth --> UI : allowed
UI -> Export : create idempotent job
Export -> Version : read immutable source
Version --> Export : content + source metadata
Export -> Object : store generated file
Export -> Audit : record format/version/actor
Export --> UI : secure time-limited download
@enduml
